@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EEF4F8
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #8FA8BD

title Модель данных — лабораторная 2

rectangle "**events**\nid, title, venue, starts_at\non_sale_at, description, status" as events
rectangle "**sectors**\nid, event_id, title, price, capacity\npersons_per_ticket" as sectors
rectangle "**tickets**\nid, event_id, sector_id\nrow, seat, status" as tickets
rectangle "**orders**\nid, user_id, event_id, status\nidempotency_key, created_at, expires_at" as orders
rectangle "**order_items**\nid, order_id, ticket_id\nprice, status" as items
rectangle "**payments**\nid, order_id, psp_reference\nstatus, amount" as payments
rectangle "**admission_passes**\nid, order_item_id, person_no\nstatus" as passes
rectangle "**refunds**\nid, order_id, payment_id\npsp_reference, amount, status\ncreated_at, reason" as refunds
rectangle "**refund_items**\nrefund_id, order_item_id" as refund_items

rectangle "**payouts**\nid, event_id, reference\namount, status, paid_at" as payouts

events --> sectors : 1 → N
events --> tickets : 1 → N
events --> orders : 1 → N
events --> payouts : 1 → 0..N

sectors --> tickets : 1 → N

orders --> items : 1 → N
tickets --> items : 1 → 0..N

orders --> payments : 1 → 0..N

items --> passes : 1 → 0..N

orders --> refunds : 1 → 0..N
payments --> refunds : 1 → 0..N
refunds --> refund_items : 1 → 0..N
items --> refund_items : 1 → 0..N

legend bottom
**Изменения в рамках 2 лабы:**

- tickets - единицы инвентаря и их текущая доступность
- order_items - связь места с конкретным заказом,
  включая историю предыдущих продаж
- admission_passes - пропуска конкретной покупки
- refunds / refund_items - возвраты и их состав
- payouts - выплаты организаторам

Дополнительно:
- events.status - позволяет отменять событие
- tickets.status - free / held / sold / blocked
- order_items.status - held / sold / refunded / cancelled
- admission_passes.status - active / revoked

История сохраняется: при возврате запись order_items
не удаляется, а место может быть продано повторно.
endlegend
@enduml
